---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Legal & Regulatory Information | AC-130 Viper" description="Read AC-130 Viper development disclaimers and the status of legal policy documents.">
  <main>
    <section class="sub-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">08 / LEGAL INFORMATION</p>
        <h1>Important website information.</h1>
        <p>Development and informational-use notices for AC-130 Viper website visitors.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section"><div class="container prose-narrow"><h2>Product-development notice</h2><p>The AC-130 Viper is under development and is not available for commercial distribution in the United States. Public product configuration, intended use, specifications and any future availability remain subject to development and applicable regulatory review.</p><h2>No medical advice or product offer</h2><p>This website provides company and development information. It does not provide medical advice, establish clinical outcomes, offer a product for sale or schedule treatment.</p><h2>Third-party media</h2><p>Embedded podcast players are provided by Spotify. Their content and data practices are subject to Spotify’s policies. Statements made by podcast participants are their own and should not be taken as device labeling, regulatory authorization or verified clinical evidence.</p><h2>Privacy policy and terms of use</h2><p>Dedicated, company-approved Privacy Policy and Terms of Use documents must be prepared and published before the production launch. This information page is not a substitute for those policies or legal review.</p></div></section>

    <section class="sub-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">STAY CONNECTED</p>
        <h2>Follow the development of AC-130 Viper.</h2>
        <p>For product-development, company, business or media inquiries, contact New York Cryogen.</p>
        <a class="button-primary" href="/contact/">Contact New York Cryogen ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
